# Mutations for FloatLock. Each names the one property that must fail on it and
# runs only where that property holds on the unmutated spec.

mutation the caps check ignores what earlier turns committed
detects CapHolds
only base refills=3
- /\ IF ~live \/ Committed + Price > Cap
+ /\ IF ~live \/ Price > Cap

mutation the reservation never lands, so the next caps read misses it
detects CapHolds
only base refills=3
- /\ visible' = [visible EXCEPT ![r] = TRUE]
-                     /\ Say(r, "ok")
+ /\ UNCHANGED visible
+                     /\ Say(r, "ok")

mutation the top-up row is not written before the send
detects MovedRecorded
only money refills=2
- /\ topUp' = [topUp EXCEPT ![r] = 1]
+ /\ UNCHANGED topUp

mutation the refill skips the live check and writes the top-up ahead on an ended connection
detects NoSendAfterEnd
only base refills=1 disc=1
- /\ IF ~live \/ Committed + Price > Cap
-                  THEN Leave(r, "refused")
-                  ELSE Go(r, "assert212") /\ UNCHANGED outcome
-             /\ UNCHANGED <<funded, lock, db, chain>>
- 
- \* hold.assertHeld() (213), then ensurePayerFunds sends only when the payer is short.
- Assert212(r) == /\ pc[r] = "assert212"
-                 /\ IF lost[r]
-                      THEN Leave(r, "error")
-                      ELSE (Go(r, "addTopUp") \/ Go(r, "skip")) /\ UNCHANGED outcome
-                 /\ UNCHANGED <<funded, lock, db, chain>>
- 
- \* writeTopUpAhead in its own tx before the send (109, store.ts:233): on an
- \* ended connection it throws, failedBeforeSend, and the turn ends in error.
- AddTopUp(r) == /\ pc[r] = "addTopUp"
-                /\ IF live
+ /\ IF Committed + Price > Cap
+                  THEN Leave(r, "refused")
+                  ELSE Go(r, "assert212") /\ UNCHANGED outcome
+             /\ UNCHANGED <<funded, lock, db, chain>>
+ 
+ \* hold.assertHeld() (213), then ensurePayerFunds sends only when the payer is short.
+ Assert212(r) == /\ pc[r] = "assert212"
+                 /\ IF lost[r]
+                      THEN Leave(r, "error")
+                      ELSE (Go(r, "addTopUp") \/ Go(r, "skip")) /\ UNCHANGED outcome
+                 /\ UNCHANGED <<funded, lock, db, chain>>
+ 
+ \* writeTopUpAhead in its own tx before the send (109, store.ts:233): on an
+ \* ended connection it throws, failedBeforeSend, and the turn ends in error.
+ AddTopUp(r) == /\ pc[r] = "addTopUp"
+                /\ IF TRUE

mutation the catch drops the funded outcome when the reserve tx fails
detects MovedReachesCaller
only money refills=2
- /\ outcome' = IF funded[r] THEN outcome ELSE [outcome EXCEPT ![r] = "error"]
+ /\ outcome' = [outcome EXCEPT ![r] = "error"]

mutation the session end keeps the lock and the wait has no lock_timeout
detects WaitEnds
only base refills=2
- Free(t) == IF lockOwner = t THEN None ELSE lockOwner
- GiveUp(t) == /\ pc[t] = "wait"
+ Free(t) == lockOwner
+ GiveUp(t) == /\ FALSE /\ pc[t] = "wait"

mutation a dropped session keeps the lock on the server
detects reach:LockStolen
- /\ lockOwner' = Free(t)
-            /\ drops' = drops + 1
+ /\ UNCHANGED lockOwner
+            /\ drops' = drops + 1

mutation onclose never sets lost
detects reach:LostSeen
- /\ lost' = [lost EXCEPT ![t] = TRUE]
+ /\ UNCHANGED lost

mutation a disconnect never ends the connection
detects reach:Ended
- /\ live' = FALSE
-           /\ Leave(d, "ok")
+ /\ UNCHANGED live
+           /\ Leave(d, "ok")

mutation addTopUp adds the amount twice
detects TypeOK
only base refills=1
- /\ topUp' = [topUp EXCEPT ![r] = 1]
+ /\ topUp' = [topUp EXCEPT ![r] = 2]

mutation an end does not wait for a top-up in flight
detects NoSendAfterEnd
only end refills=1 disc=1 drops=1
- /\ ~InFlight
-           /\ live' = FALSE
+ /\ live' = FALSE

mutation the top-up is written ahead whether or not the connection is live
detects NoSendAfterEnd
only end refills=1 disc=1 drops=1
- /\ IF live
-                     THEN /\ topUp' = [topUp EXCEPT ![r] = 1]
+ /\ IF TRUE
+                     THEN /\ topUp' = [topUp EXCEPT ![r] = 1]

mutation revokeByGrant ends past its deadline under a top-up in flight
detects NoSendAfterEnd
only end refills=1 revoke=1
- /\ lockOwner # None
-                /\ ~InFlight
+ /\ lockOwner # None
